# Notification Center: panel at the right under the bar (x≈1530..1912 Material, 1544..1912 Glass); read rows from the first shot
look glass
wait 2
ipc panels open notificationCenter TESSERA-TEST
wait 1
note To-do tab (from shot)
note start the Focus timer first; double-click a to-do and type slowly 10 s: text kept; Enter keeps it
key '   ' -k Return
note spaces only + Enter: nothing added
shot todo
ipc panels close
